1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,480
This is how you add a voiceover to screen recordings.

2
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:04,240
Long hold the screen record button.

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,679
Click on microphone.

4
00:00:05,679 --> 00:00:07,200
Click on start recording.

5
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,120
Now you can add voiceover.

